> [13]: Ochre(?) Dragons with a sickness breath attack. Ochre Dragon
> Scale mail provides sickness reistsance (too powerful? maybe it
> converts the instadeath to damage). -ekiM

Interesting.  It would put ochre dragons into the running for top-tier
dragon armor, and actually wouldn't be too unbalancing I'd think, since
the player couldn't wear gray or silver at the same time.  It'd be a
fairly dangerous opponent to encounter, but once it's killed a potion
of extra or full healing later and the player's better again.

I am not too certain of the dev team's perception of the purpose of
